---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Community | Citizen Stewardship"
  description="Public participation guide for discussion, criticism, and improvement of the proposals."
>
  <h1>Community</h1>
  <p>Use this project as a public workshop. Read hard, disagree constructively, and improve what is weak.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Read both proposals.</li>
    <li>Comment on the proposals.</li>
    <li>Suggest improvements.</li>
    <li>Challenge assumptions.</li>
    <li>Point out missing pillars.</li>
    <li>Offer better wording.</li>
    <li>Turn ideas into model laws.</li>
    <li>Submit local reform examples.</li>
    <li>Share research and sources.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Discuss Proposal One</a>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">Discuss Proposal Two</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Submit a Public Proposal</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Suggest a Site Improvement</a>
  </div>

  <section class="section placeholder">
    <h2>Giscus General Discussion Placeholder</h2>
    <p>General public discussion will appear here after Giscus is configured.</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
